# =============================================================
# tts-models.manifest — TTS (text-to-speech) model SSOT
# =============================================================
# Engine: mlx-audio (Apple Silicon). Not served by Ollama.
# Pull weights: lm pull-tts [repo]   -> ~/models/tts/<basename>/
# Synthesize:   lm tts "text" [--model <id>] [--voice ...]
#
# Roles:
#   primary = fast daily (Kokoro ~375MB)
#   alt     = max quality on this Mac (Qwen3-TTS 1.7B CustomVoice ~4GB)
#
# Fields: ROLE|MODEL_ID|HF_REPO|ENGINE|DEFAULT_VOICE
#   ROLE          : primary=default  alt=quality  retired=to delete
#   MODEL_ID      : short name for lm tts --model
#   HF_REPO       : Hugging Face / mlx-community repo (pulled via hf-mirror curl)
#   ENGINE        : mlx-audio
#   DEFAULT_VOICE : Kokoro: af_heart / zf_xiaoxiao; Qwen3 CustomVoice: Serena / Vivian
#   Qwen3 speakers: serena, vivian, uncle_fu, ryan, aiden, ono_anna, sohee, eric, dylan
# =============================================================

primary|kokoro-82m|mlx-community/Kokoro-82M-bf16|mlx-audio|af_heart
